  Todo el documento va dentro de raw para que Liquid no toque el JavaScript. Solo hay 3 piezas Liquid:
  las 2 fuentes (asset_url) y content_for_header / content_for_layout (obligatorios en Shopify).
{% endcomment %}
{% raw %}<!doctype html>
<!--
  TECUNELO · home v18 (fichas de producto rediseñadas; 3D nítido) · UN SOLO DOCUMENTO (tienda + páginas legales dentro)
  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  CHECKLIST LEGAL (España) — borrador, revisar con abogado/asesoría antes de publicar
  Datos a rellenar (busca [RELLENAR] y [DECIDIR] en este archivo):
   - Titular, NIF, domicilio, correo, teléfono, registro mercantil si eres sociedad
   - Quién paga la devolución (tienda o cliente): escribirlo igual en TODOS los textos
   - Ámbito de venta (península / Baleares / Canarias / Ceuta y Melilla)
   - Plazo de entrega real (tras pedido de prueba), gastos de envío reales, métodos de pago activos
   - Correo de soporte y horario; variable EMAIL en el script del botón de desistimiento (al final del archivo)
   - Dirección de devoluciones en España/UE
  Antes de publicar:
   1. Alta de actividad (autónomo o sociedad), IVA y OSS si vendes a otros países UE -> gestoría
   2. Revisión de los textos legales por abogado o asesoría
   3. Fuentes: guardar fonts/anton-400.woff2 y fonts/manrope-var.woff2 (Anton y Manrope, licencia OFL).
      Hasta entonces se usa una fuente de reserva y el aspecto cambia.
   4. three.js: descargar y servir desde tu dominio (hoy se carga desde cdnjs)
   5. Hoja de quejas y reclamaciones: sistema de la Junta de Andalucía
   6. Por producto: fabricante/responsable UE, advertencias en español, declaración UE de conformidad si aplica
   7. RAEE y pilas: número de registro del productor; envases: aclarar con el proveedor quién cumple
   8. Fotos reales (propias o con permiso escrito del proveedor)
   9. En Shopify: Configuración > Políticas, banner de cookies conforme, botón de desistimiento con acuse automático
  10. Precios tachados / rebajas: solo con precio de referencia = el más bajo de los 30 días previos
  11. ARANCEL UE: desde el 1/7/2026 hay 3 EUR por categoría de producto en paquetes de menos de 150 EUR enviados desde fuera de la UE
      (y se prevé una tasa de gestión). El transportista no puede cobrárselo al cliente: mételo en tus costes o usa proveedor con almacén en la UE.
  12. Ley 10/2025 de atención a la clientela: afecta a servicios básicos y grandes empresas, no a una tienda pequeña. Basta con correo y respuesta ágil.
  13. Botón de desistimiento (Directiva UE 2023/2673, aplicable desde el 19/6/2026): ya incluido. Comprueba si España ya la ha transpuesto.
  14. El botón final del pago debe decir "Pedido con obligación de pago" o fórmula equivalente (art. 98.2 TRLGDCU). Revísalo en el checkout.
  15. Ámbito de venta: solo península y Baleares (Canarias, Ceuta y Melilla tienen otro régimen fiscal y aduanero).
  16. Devoluciones: texto decidido = coste de devolver por cuenta del cliente (legal si se informa antes de pagar). Defectos y garantía: gratis para el cliente.
  17. Fichas de producto: contrasta cada descripción y característica con el modelo real de tu proveedor y sustituye todos los [CONFIRMAR]/[RELLENAR].
  Catálogo: 14 productos pasivos publicados; 22 en PRODUCTOS_FASE2 (comentados) hasta tener CE, declaración de conformidad y RAEE.
-->

<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>TECUNELO — Tecnología que conecta contigo</title>
<meta name="description" content="TECUNELO: accesorios de tecnología para tu escritorio, tu hogar y tu coche. Envío con seguimiento, 14 días para desistir y 3 años de garantía legal.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#06100A">
<meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:site_name" content="TECUNELO"><meta property="og:locale" content="es_ES">
<meta property="og:title" content="TECUNELO — Tecnología que conecta contigo"><meta property="og:description" content="Accesorios de tecnología bien elegidos. Envío con seguimiento y soporte en español.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='16' fill='%2306100A'/%3E%3Ctext x='32' y='46' font-size='40' font-family='Impact,sans-serif' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23C8FF3D'%3ET%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style>
/* ####### FUENTES ALOJADAS EN TU PROPIA WEB (sin enviar la IP del visitante a Google) #######
   Descarga Anton y Manrope (licencia libre OFL) y guárdalas en la carpeta fonts/ con estos nombres. */
@font-face{font-family:Anton;src:url({% endraw %}{{ 'anton-400.woff2' | asset_url }}{% raw %}) format("woff2");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:Manrope;src:url({% endraw %}{{ 'manrope-var.woff2' | asset_url }}{% raw %}) format("woff2");font-weight:300 800;font-display:swap}
/* ####### BASE Y COLORES ####### */
:root{--bg:#06100A;--glass:rgb(6 16 10/.6);--ink:#F1F4E8;--mut:#A4B09C;--line:#22352A;--card:#0E1D14;--ac:hsl(75 100% 62%);--e:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);--s:cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1);color-scheme:dark;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
:root:not([data-theme="light"]),:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#06100A}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.5 Manrope,sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
#gl{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:0}
main,header,footer,.nl{position:relative;z-index:1}
.disp{font-family:Anton,Impact,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:400;line-height:.92}
.wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
.js .rv{opacity:0;transform:perspective(900px) translateY(50px) rotateX(16deg);filter:blur(8px);transition:opacity .9s var(--e) var(--d,0ms),transform .9s var(--e) var(--d,0ms),filter .9s var(--e) var(--d,0ms)}
.js .rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none;filter:none}
.js .row.rv{transition:opacity .9s var(--e),transform .9s var(--e),filter .9s var(--e),padding .4s var(--e)}

/* ####### CARGA ####### */
#ld{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:100;background:var(--bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;font:400 clamp(28px,6vw,64px) Anton,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;transition:opacity .6s var(--e)}
#ld.off{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
#ld b{color:var(--ac);font-weight:400}

/* ####### PROMO ####### */
#promo{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;z-index:7;background:var(--ac);color:#0A1408;text-align:center;padding:8px 12px;font:600 14px Manrope,sans-serif}

/* ####### CABECERA ####### */
header{position:fixed;top:36px;left:0;width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 24px;z-index:50;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:padding .3s var(--e),background .3s,border-color .3s}
header.sc{padding:10px 24px;background:rgb(6 16 10/.78);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
.logo{font:400 26px Anton,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase}
header nav{display:flex;gap:28px;color:var(--mut)}
#cart{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 18px;font-weight:600}

/* ####### PORTADA ####### */
.hero{min-height:100vh;min-height:100dvh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:120px 20px 24px;position:relative}
h1{font-size:clamp(60px,15vw,230px)}
h1 em{display:block;font-style:normal;color:var(--ac);font-size:clamp(26px,6.4vw,96px);min-height:1em;margin-top:6px}
.hero p{max-width:460px;color:var(--mut);margin:20px 0 0}
.hero p.cp{position:absolute;bottom:128px}
#h1{will-change:transform}
.lt{display:inline-block;opacity:0}
.go .lt{animation:lt 1s var(--e) both;animation-delay:calc(var(--i)*55ms)}
@keyframes lt{from{opacity:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateX(-95deg) translateY(.4em) scale(.9);filter:blur(10px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none;filter:none}}

/* ####### BOTONES ####### */
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ac);color:#0A1408;font:600 16px Manrope,sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .2s ease-out}
.btn.g{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.btn.sm{min-height:40px;padding:0 18px;font-size:14px;align-self:flex-start;transform:translateZ(30px)}

/* ####### SELECTOR DE CATEGORÍAS ####### */
#c{position:absolute;bottom:40px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:min(880px,calc(100vw - 32px));height:64px;z-index:6;transition:width 800ms var(--s);--cl:-5px;--cw:calc(16.666% + 5px)}
#c.sel{width:220px}
.gl{position:absolute;border-radius:999px;pointer-events:none;-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px) saturate(130%);backdrop-filter:blur(12px) saturate(130%)}
.gl::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:inherit;padding:1px;background:conic-gradient(from 225deg,var(--ac),rgb(255 255 255/.35),#fff,rgb(255 255 255/.35),var(--ac));-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000 0 0);mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;opacity:.35}
.tk{inset:3px 0;background:rgb(20 50 32/.4);box-shadow:inset 1px 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.4),0 14px 38px rgb(0 0 0/.3);transition:opacity .4s linear}
#c.sel .tk{opacity:0;transition-delay:.5s}
.cp2{top:-4px;height:72px;left:var(--cl);width:var(--cw);background:rgb(240 255 235/.14);box-shadow:inset 1px 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.55),0 11px 28px rgb(0 0 0/.3);transition:left 620ms var(--e),width 620ms var(--e)}
#c.sel .cp2{left:-5px;width:calc(100% + 10px);transition:left 800ms var(--s),width 800ms var(--s)}
.cells{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);align-items:center;z-index:1}
#c.sel .cells{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.cell{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;font:400 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:0;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .4s var(--e),filter .4s var(--e)}
.cell.lb{cursor:default;pointer-events:none}
#c.sel .cell:not(.reset){position:absolute;opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);pointer-events:none}
.reset{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}

/* ####### BANDA ####### */
.band{overflow:hidden;border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 0;margin-top:0;background:rgb(6 16 10/.75);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.track{display:flex;gap:48px;width:max-content;animation:mq 28s linear infinite}
.track span{font:400 clamp(44px,7vw,96px) Anton,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--ac)}
@keyframes mq{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

/* ####### GANCHOS ####### */
.msg{padding:100px 0 90px;background:var(--glass);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(3px);backdrop-filter:blur(3px)}
.msg p{font:600 clamp(26px,4.2vw,58px)/1.12 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:17em}
.msg b{color:var(--ac);font-weight:700}
.msg svg{display:block;margin-top:28px;width:150px;stroke:var(--ac);fill:none;stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round}
.hk{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:40px;list-style:none;padding:0}
.hk li{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 18px;color:var(--mut);font-size:15px}
.hk li b{color:var(--ac);font-weight:700}
.hk{counter-reset:h}
.hk li::before{counter-increment:h;content:counter(h,decimal-leading-zero);color:var(--ac);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;margin-right:10px}
.msg .btn{margin-top:36px}
.js .hk li.in:hover{transform:translateY(-4px) perspective(600px) rotateX(8deg);border-color:var(--ac)}

/* ####### PRODUCTOS ####### */
.top{background:var(--glass);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(3px);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);padding:60px 0 100px;scroll-margin-top:72px}
.top .h{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:20px;margin-bottom:36px}
.top h2{font-size:clamp(48px,9vw,130px)}
.rail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(100%,270px),1fr));gap:20px;padding:0 24px 28px;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
.tilt{position:relative;height:420px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:32px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .2s ease-out;overflow:hidden;--gx:50%;--gy:50%}
.tilt:nth-child(even){border-radius:8px 44px 8px 44px}
.tilt::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(240px circle at var(--gx) var(--gy),rgb(255 255 255/.13),transparent 60%);pointer-events:none}
.ph{flex:1;margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:20px;background:#0A150E;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--mut);transform:translateZ(40px);transition:background .3s}
.tilt:hover .ph{background:var(--ac);color:#0A1408}
.tilt h3{font:400 30px Anton,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;transform:translateZ(30px)}
.tilt .pr{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--mut);transform:translateZ(30px)}
.tilt h3{font-size:26px}
body[data-cat="1"] .tilt:not([data-c="1"]),body[data-cat="2"] .tilt:not([data-c="2"]),body[data-cat="3"] .tilt:not([data-c="3"]),body[data-cat="4"] .tilt:not([data-c="4"]),body[data-cat="5"] .tilt:not([data-c="5"]){display:none}
.bd{position:absolute;top:16px;left:16px;z-index:2;background:var(--ac);color:#0A1408;font:700 14px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;transform:translateZ(50px)}
.bd.h{left:auto;right:16px;background:#fff}
.tilt .pn{font:400 30px Anton,sans-serif;color:var(--ac)}
.tilt .po{font:400 16px Manrope,sans-serif;color:var(--mut);margin-left:8px}
.tilt .sv{color:var(--ac);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;transform:translateZ(30px)}
.ph svg{width:96px;height:96px}
.ph{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.ph img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:20px}
.nt{color:var(--mut);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px}
.cnt{color:var(--mut);font-size:15px;margin:-8px auto 20px}
.tilt[hidden]{display:none}
.top .nt{padding:0 24px}

/* ####### CÓMO FUNCIONA ####### */
.rows{background:var(--glass);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(3px);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);padding:40px 0 140px}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px 32px;align-items:center;padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);transition:padding .4s var(--e)}
.row:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.row h3{font-size:clamp(48px,9vw,128px);transition:color .3s}
.row>span,.row>div{color:var(--mut);font-size:19px}
.row:hover{padding-left:20px}.row:hover h3{color:var(--ac)}
.pasos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;padding:0 0 64px}
.pa{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;padding:28px;background:var(--card);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;overflow:hidden}
.pa i{font:400 96px/1 Anton,sans-serif;font-style:normal;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--ac)}
.pa h3{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,56px)}
.pa span{color:var(--mut)}
.js .pa.in:hover{transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(6deg) rotateY(-8deg) translateY(-8px);border-color:var(--ac)}
.pay{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:16px}
.pay li{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:8px 16px;font:600 15px Manrope,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--card)}

/* ####### PIE ####### */
footer{background:var(--glass);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(3px);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);padding:48px 24px 48px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.nl h2{font-size:clamp(44px,11vw,170px);max-width:12em}
form{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:36px 0 56px}
input{min-height:48px;padding:0 20px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);font:16px Manrope,sans-serif;width:min(100%,320px)}
.fl{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--mut);font-size:14px}
.fl a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;margin-right:14px}
.nl{background:var(--glass);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(3px);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);padding:100px 24px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
footer .pay{margin:0 0 28px}
.lg{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0}
.lg summary{cursor:pointer;font:600 17px Manrope,sans-serif;list-style:none}
.lg summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.lg summary::after{content:"+";float:right;color:var(--ac)}
.lg[open] summary::after{content:"–"}
.lg p{color:var(--mut);margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;max-width:60ch}
.lg:last-of-type{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:32px}

/* ####### MENÚ DEL CATÁLOGO ####### */
.lh{display:flex;align-items:center}
.hb{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:5px;width:44px;height:44px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;margin-right:12px}
.hb i{display:block;width:18px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .3s var(--e)}
.hb:hover i:nth-child(1){transform:translateX(3px)}.hb:hover i:nth-child(3){transform:translateX(-3px)}
.dr{position:fixed;top:0;bottom:0;width:min(420px,92vw);z-index:60;background:rgb(10 22 14/.96);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border:0 solid var(--line);padding:calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)) 24px calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;overflow-y:auto;visibility:hidden;transition:transform .55s var(--e),visibility 0s linear .55s}
.dr.l{left:0;border-right-width:1px;transform:translateX(-105%)}
.dr.r{right:0;border-left-width:1px;transform:translateX(105%)}
.dr.on{transform:none;visibility:visible;transition:transform .55s var(--e),visibility 0s}
.ov{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:55;background:rgb(0 0 0/.55);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .4s}
.ov.on{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
body.nsc{overflow:hidden}
.dh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.dh h2{font-size:44px}
.x{width:44px;height:44px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font-size:18px;cursor:pointer}
.mi{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;width:100%;padding:18px 4px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font:400 34px Anton,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;transition:padding .3s var(--e),color .3s}
.mi em{font:600 14px Manrope,sans-serif;color:var(--mut);font-style:normal}
.mi:hover,.mi.a{padding-left:14px;color:var(--ac)}
.ml{display:flex;gap:18px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px}

/* ####### CARRITO ####### */
#cart{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font:600 16px Manrope,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}
#cart svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
#cart b{min-width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ac);color:#0A1408;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;padding:0 6px}
#cart.bump b{animation:bump .5s var(--e)}
@keyframes bump{40%{transform:scale(1.6)}}
.ci{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:4px 12px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.ci b:nth-child(2){text-align:right}.ci span{color:var(--mut);font-size:14px}
.q{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-self:end;grid-column:2}
.q button{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;font-size:18px}
.tot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:400 32px Anton,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:auto}
.vac{color:var(--mut)}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}

/* ####### LIQUID GLASS (estilo iOS) ####### */
:root{--glass:rgb(8 20 14/.42);--gl:linear-gradient(145deg,rgb(255 255 255/.14),rgb(255 255 255/.04));--gb:1px solid rgb(255 255 255/.18);--gs:inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.4),inset 0 -1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.06),0 16px 40px rgb(0 0 0/.3)}
#au{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none}
#au i{position:absolute;width:70vmax;height:70vmax;border-radius:50%;animation:au 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
#au i:nth-child(1){left:-25vmax;top:-20vmax;background:radial-gradient(circle,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ac) 38%,transparent),transparent 65%)}
#au i:nth-child(2){right:-30vmax;top:30vh;animation-duration:28s;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgb(0 140 255/.26),transparent 65%)}
#au i:nth-child(3){left:10vmax;bottom:-35vmax;animation-duration:34s;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgb(190 80 255/.22),transparent 65%)}
@keyframes au{to{transform:translate(8vmax,6vmax) scale(1.15)}}
header{left:12px;width:calc(100% - 24px);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 10px 8px 8px;background:var(--gl),rgb(10 22 14/.35);border:var(--gb);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(180%);backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(180%);box-shadow:var(--gs)}
header.sc{padding:8px 10px 8px 8px;background:var(--gl),rgb(10 22 14/.6)}
.hb,#cart{background:rgb(255 255 255/.1);border:var(--gb);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.4)}
.tilt{background:var(--gl),rgb(10 22 14/.35);border:var(--gb);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(170%);backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(170%);box-shadow:var(--gs)}
.tilt::after{background:radial-gradient(240px circle at var(--gx) var(--gy),rgb(255 255 255/.22),transparent 60%)}
.ph{background:rgb(0 0 0/.22);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.12)}
.hk li,.pay li,.pa,.lg{background:rgb(255 255 255/.07);border:var(--gb);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.3)}
.lg{border-radius:20px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:10px}
input{background:rgb(255 255 255/.08);border:var(--gb);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px)}
.btn{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,rgb(255 255 255/.5),rgb(255 255 255/0) 55%);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.75),0 10px 28px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ac) 40%,transparent)}
.btn::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(110deg,transparent 35%,rgb(255 255 255/.6) 50%,transparent 65%);transform:translateX(-130%);animation:sh 4s ease-in-out infinite;pointer-events:none}
@keyframes sh{0%,60%{transform:translateX(-130%)}100%{transform:translateX(130%)}}
.btn.g{background:rgb(255 255 255/.08);background-image:none;border:var(--gb);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.4)}
.btn.g::after,.btn:disabled::after{display:none}
.bd.h{animation:pl 2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pl{50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgb(255 255 255/0),0 0 22px rgb(255 255 255/.7)}}
.dr{top:12px;bottom:12px;width:min(420px,calc(100vw - 24px));border-radius:32px;background:var(--gl),rgb(10 22 14/.55);border:var(--gb);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(30px) saturate(200%);backdrop-filter:blur(30px) saturate(200%);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255/.5),0 30px 80px rgb(0 0 0/.55)}
.dr.l{left:12px;transform:translateX(-115%)}.dr.r{right:12px;transform:translateX(115%)}
.dr.l.on,.dr.r.on{transform:none}
.ts{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));transform:translate(-50%,180%);z-index:58;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--gl),rgb(10 22 14/.6);border:var(--gb);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(180%);backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(180%);box-shadow:var(--gs);cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;max-width:calc(100vw - 24px);transition:transform .5s var(--e)}
.ts.on{transform:translate(-50%,0)}.ts b{color:var(--ac);white-space:nowrap}
.cf{position:fixed;width:8px;height:12px;border-radius:2px;z-index:200;pointer-events:none;animation:cf 1.1s var(--e) forwards}
@keyframes cf{to{transform:translate(var(--dx),var(--dy)) rotate(var(--r));opacity:0}}
.fs{display:grid;gap:10px;padding:14px;border-radius:20px;background:rgb(255 255 255/.07);border:var(--gb);font-size:14px}
.bar{height:10px;border-radius:99px;background:rgb(255 255 255/.12);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0/.4)}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ac),#fff);box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--ac);transition:width .7s var(--e)}
.sg{display:grid;gap:8px}.sg h4{font:600 14px Manrope,sans-serif;color:var(--mut)}
.su{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:16px;background:rgb(255 255 255/.06);border:var(--gb)}
.su b{font-size:14px}.su span{color:var(--ac);font-weight:600;font-size:14px}.su .btn{min-height:34px;padding:0 12px;font-size:13px}
.cd{display:flex;gap:8px}.cd input{flex:1;min-width:0;width:auto;min-height:44px}.cd .btn{min-height:44px;padding:0 18px}
.chip{border:1px dashed var(--ac);background:rgb(255 255 255/.05);color:var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 12px;font:14px Manrope,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;text-align:left}
.chip b{color:var(--ac)}
.cmsg{font-size:14px;min-height:18px}.cmsg.ok{color:var(--ac)}.cmsg.er{color:#ff9a9a}
.rs{display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:15px}.rs div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--mut)}.rs .ds{color:var(--ac)}

/* ####### CURSOR ####### */
#dot,#ring{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:90;border-radius:50%}
#dot{width:6px;height:6px;margin:-3px;background:var(--ac)}
#ring{width:36px;height:36px;margin:-18px;border:1px solid var(--ac);transition:width .2s,height .2s,margin .2s,background .2s}
#ring.big{width:64px;height:64px;margin:-32px;background:rgb(210 255 60/.12)}
@media (pointer:coarse){#dot,#ring{display:none}}

/* ####### ACCESIBILIDAD ####### */
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ac);outline-offset:3px}
.sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.track,#au i,.btn::after,.bd.h{animation:none}html{scroll-behavior:auto}#c,.cp2,.tk,.tilt,.btn,.row{transition-duration:1ms!important;transition-delay:0s!important}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.js .rv{opacity:1;transform:none;filter:none;transition:none}.lt{opacity:1}.go .lt{animation:none}}

/* ####### RESPONSIVE ####### */
@media (max-width:760px){header nav{display:none}.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero p.cp{bottom:276px}#c{height:200px}#c.sel{height:64px}.cells{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:44px 52px 52px 52px}#c.sel .cells{grid-template-rows:64px;grid-template-columns:1fr}.cell.lb,.cells>:nth-child(6){grid-column:1/-1}.cells>:nth-child(n+2){border-top:1px solid rgb(255 255 255/.12);border-radius:0}.cells>:nth-child(3),.cells>:nth-child(5){border-left:1px solid rgb(255 255 255/.12)}#c.sel .cells>*{border-color:transparent}.gl{border-radius:28px}.cp2{display:none}.tk{inset:0}#c.sel .tk{opacity:1;transition-delay:0s}}
@media (max-width:760px){.pasos{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cl2{display:none}#cart{padding:8px 12px}.msg{padding:70px 0 60px}.top{padding:40px 0 70px}}
@media (max-width:560px){.rail{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;padding:0 14px 24px}.tilt{height:350px;padding:12px;border-radius:20px}.tilt:nth-child(even){border-radius:6px 28px 6px 28px}.tilt h3{font-size:17px}.tilt .pn{font-size:22px}.tilt .po{font-size:13px;margin-left:4px}.tilt .sv{font-size:12px}.btn.sm{padding:0 12px;font-size:13px;min-height:38px}.bd{font-size:11px;top:10px;left:10px;padding:3px 9px}.bd.h{left:auto;right:10px}.ph svg{width:64px;height:64px}.logo{font-size:22px}}

/* ############################################################
   ####### V7 · MEJORAS DE PRUEBA (marcadas con ①②③④) #######
   ############################################################ */
/* --- Marcas visibles (se pueden ocultar con el botón de abajo) --- */
.mk{position:absolute;z-index:30;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 12px 5px 5px;border-radius:999px;background:#ff3d81;color:#fff;font:700 12px/1.2 Manrope,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgb(0 0 0/.45),0 0 0 3px rgb(255 61 129/.28);pointer-events:none;animation:mkp 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;max-width:calc(100vw - 32px)}
.mk b{flex:none;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;color:#ff3d81;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 13px Manrope,sans-serif}
.mk.s{position:static;margin:0 0 14px}
.mk.f{position:fixed;right:44px;top:calc(50% - 15px)}
@keyframes mkp{50%{box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgb(0 0 0/.45),0 0 0 8px rgb(255 61 129/0)}}
body.nomk .mk{display:none}
#mkt{position:fixed;left:12px;bottom:12px;z-index:70;min-height:40px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgb(255 255 255/.25);background:rgb(6 16 10/.8);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);color:#fff;font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}

/* --- Anti-movimiento lateral: la página solo se desliza arriba/abajo --- */
html{overflow-x:clip;overscroll-behavior-x:none}
html,body{max-width:100%;touch-action:pan-y pinch-zoom}
body{overflow-x:clip}
.mk{white-space:normal;width:max-content}
/* --- Carrito/menú limpios: se ocultan marcas y puntos mientras están abiertos --- */
body.nsc .mk,body.nsc #sn,body.nsc #mkt{display:none}
.dr{background:rgb(8 18 12/.94)!important;-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(26px) saturate(115%)!important;backdrop-filter:blur(26px) saturate(115%)!important}
@media (max-width:760px){.mk.f{right:32px}}
/* --- ③ Navegación de escenas (puntos laterales) --- */
#sn{position:fixed;right:12px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:55;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
#sn button{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgb(255 255 255/.55);background:transparent;padding:0;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .4s var(--e),background .4s,box-shadow .4s}
#sn button.on{background:var(--ac);border-color:var(--ac);transform:scale(1.6);box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--ac)}

/* --- ② Tarjetas: tilt 3D suave + brillo especular + luz de borde --- */
.tilt{transition:box-shadow .3s ease-out;will-change:transform;box-shadow:var(--gs),calc(var(--tx,0)*-26px) calc(var(--ty,0)*-26px + 20px) 44px -14px rgb(0 0 0/calc(.2 + var(--o,0)*.4))}
.tilt::after{background:radial-gradient(circle at var(--gx) var(--gy),rgb(255 255 255/.7),rgb(255 255 255/.14) 26%,transparent 52%);mix-blend-mode:overlay;opacity:var(--o,0);z-index:3}
.tilt::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:inherit;padding:1.5px;background:radial-gradient(170px circle at var(--gx) var(--gy),rgb(255 255 255/.95),transparent 70%);-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000 0 0);mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;opacity:var(--o,0);pointer-events:none;z-index:4}
.tilt .ph{transform:translate(calc(var(--tx,0)*-12px),calc(var(--ty,0)*-12px))}
.tilt h3,.tilt .pr,.tilt .sv,.tilt .btn.sm{transform:translate(calc(var(--tx,0)*9px),calc(var(--ty,0)*9px))}
.tilt .bd{transform:translate(calc(var(--tx,0)*16px),calc(var(--ty,0)*16px))}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.mk{animation:none}}

/* ############ V10 · CARRITO CALMADO + AVISO NUEVO ############ */
/* Carrito: menos bloques, menos ruido */
